.TH CBMAP_SIZE 3 "2026-10-31" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
cbmap_size \- get the number of entries in a BST map (type-inferred wrapper)
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/cbstmap.h>

cbmap_size(cbm);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Type-inferred wrapper for cbstmap_elem_count(). It takes the same arguments
and gives the same result; cbstmap_elem_count(3) has the full contract.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
cbm    BST map to query
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
The number of entries in the map.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cbstmap_elem_count (3)
